  "headline": "FDA's records show enoxaparin sodium is not on the shortage list as of 2026-10-21; Sanofi-Aventis U.S. LLC posted a discontinuation on 2026-10-20",
  "headline_cites": ["D4", "E8"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list does not include enoxaparin sodium as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Sanofi-Aventis U.S. LLC posted a discontinuation of its enoxaparin sodium injection for the U.S. market on 2026-10-20, stating the decision is not related to safety or quality concerns.",
      "cites": ["E8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A registered plant for a BluePoint Laboratories label is Nanjing King-Friend Biochemical Pharmaceutical Co., Ltd. (FEI 3010625707) in China, which received VAI classifications in 2015, 2018, and 2023.",
      "cites": ["E7", "E4", "E5", "E6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Current inventory at Corvale East provides 10.9 days on hand for the 60 mg/0.6 mL presentation and 24.5 days for the 100 mg/mL 0.8 mL presentation; Corvale General has 14.5 days for the 100 mg/mL 0.8 mL presentation.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2", "D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The top-ranked purchasing option is to buy from Amphastar Pharmaceuticals, Inc., which is not on FDA's shortage list today, though its label names no plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Additional alternate manufacturers not on the shortage list include BE Pharmaceuticals Inc. and Civica, Inc., each with labels that name no plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["D6", "D7"]
    }
  ]
